<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM, Oman Air start code-sharing Aug 1.</title>
<headline>KLM, Oman Air start code-sharing Aug 1.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLM Royal Dutch Airlines N.V. and Oman Air have formed a code-sharing agreement, effective from August 1, a KLM spokesman said.</p>
<p>KLM flies from Amsterdam to Muscat, the capital of Oman, four-times-a-week with a Boeing 747, via Dubai.</p>
<p>On the three days when KLM does not serve Oman directly, KLM will code-share on Oman Air's Airbus 320 between Dubai and Muscat, said the spokesman.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+5017</p>
